paragraph('app','Table~\\ref{tab:synthetic-column-witnesses} holds',r'Table~\ref{tab:synthetic-column-witnesses} reports the complete controlled comparison, including the zero-budget case summarized in Section~7.7. At $m=128,T=12,d=1,b=307$, the common minimum entry certificate size is 1,229; shared support requires ten columns and the other layouts eleven. Holding row costs fixed isolates the effect of shared evidence on column certificate cost. The experiment does not assess NLP quality or inference time.'+'\n'+r'\input{tables/synthetic-column-witnesses}',[170])

